  "prefLabel": "Nur 101.20 Stable client",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Nur 101.20 “Stable client” means a client whose overall health status, as assessed by a licensed nurse, is at the expected baseline or with predictable or expected responses that can occur with known chronic or long term medical conditions.\n\nSource. #10296, eff 3-22-13 (from Nur 101.20); ss by #10569, eff 4-17-14 (from Nur 101.20) (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Nur 100); renumbered by #13672 (formerly Nur 101.21)",
